.TH SDE-PANEL 1 "October 2026" "SDE 0.1 Alpha" "Selviana Desktop Environment"
.SH NAME
sde-panel \- taskbar, application menu, system tray and clock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sde-panel
[\-\-menu | \-\-version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBsde-panel\fR shows the bottom panel: application menu with search, pinned applications, the list of open windows, a system tray, battery status and a clock.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-menu
Open or close the application menu of the running panel (bound to the Super key).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/sde/sde.conf
System-wide default settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/sde.conf
Per-user settings, written by \fBsde-settings\fR(1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sde-session (1),
.BR sde-panel (1),
.BR sde-desktop (1),
.BR sde-settings (1)
.SH BUGS
SDE 0.1 is an alpha release. Please report problems at
